{"ID":"20250207121757-68o5nrc","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250207121757-68o5nrc","title":"A2L4——空间复杂度","type":"doc","updated":"20250207124831"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207121757-6lsgde7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250207121757-6lsgde7","updated":"20250207122730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空间复杂度"}]},{"ID":"20250207121953-k38ohxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207121953-k38ohxq","updated":"20250207122019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"u","TextMarkTextContent":"空间复杂度（space complexity）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用于衡量算法占用内存空间随着数据量变大时的增长趋势。\n这个概念与 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250130155536-2fewj2v","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"时间复杂度"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 非常类似，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"只需将“运行时间”替换为“占用内存空间”。"}]},{"ID":"20250207122019-crjswl4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250207122019-crjswl4","updated":"20250207122730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"算法相关空间"}]},{"ID":"20250207122034-da3s2ri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-da3s2ri","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"算法在运行过程中使用的内存空间主要包括以下几种。"}]},{"ID":"20250207122034-gp0de9m","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-gp0de9m","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207122034-uizr6zq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-uizr6zq","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207122034-6wt30ec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-6wt30ec","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"输入空间"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：用于存储算法的输入数据。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250207122034-c1v570z","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-c1v570z","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207122034-9ip9s80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-9ip9s80","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"暂存空间"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：用于存储算法在运行过程中的变量、对象、函数上下文等数据。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250207122034-a9208gd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-a9208gd","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207122034-b8e9olt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-b8e9olt","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"输出空间"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：用于存储算法的输出数据。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250207122034-3gokk3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-3gokk3o","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般情况下，空间复杂度的统计范围是“暂存空间”加上“输出空间”。"}]},{"ID":"20250207122034-6qvfhs1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-6qvfhs1","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"暂存空间可以进一步划分为三个部分。"}]},{"ID":"20250207122034-2g7xw1f","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-2g7xw1f","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207122034-50m74gi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-50m74gi","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207122034-yoq6j53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-yoq6j53","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"暂存数据"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：用于保存算法运行过程中的各种常量、变量、对象等。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250207122034-ge1scu2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-ge1scu2","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207122034-knfabzj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-knfabzj","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"栈帧空间"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：用于保存调用函数的上下文数据。系统在每次调用函数时都会在栈顶部创建一个栈帧，函数返回后，栈帧空间会被释放。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250207122034-2xrz0km","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-2xrz0km","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207122034-bj4f2ax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-bj4f2ax","updated":"20250207122034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"指令空间"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：用于保存编译后的程序指令，在实际统计中通常忽略不计。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250207122034-kufqr6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122034-kufqr6a","updated":"20250207122038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在分析一段程序的空间复杂度时，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"我们通常统计暂存数据、栈帧空间和输出数据三部分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如图所示。"}]},{"ID":"20250207122112-ecxih4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122112-ecxih4s","updated":"20250207122112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 573px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250207122112-fu7mqg0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 573px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250207122715-atafc2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122715-atafc2h","updated":"20250207122721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代码如下："}]},{"ID":"20250207122721-50r0h82","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250207122721-50r0h82","updated":"20250207122725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"int Algorithm(int n)        // 输入数据\n{\n    const int a = 0;        // 暂存数据（常量）\n    int b = 0;              // 暂存数据（变量）\n    Node node = new(0);     // 暂存数据（对象）\n    int c = Function();     // 栈帧空间（调用函数）\n    return a + b + c;       // 输出数据\n}\n\nint Function()\n{\n    // 执行某些操作\n    return 0;\n}\n\nclass Node(int x)\n{\n    int val = x;\n    Node next;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250207122730-aglzypf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250207122730-aglzypf","updated":"20250207123218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"推算方法"}]},{"ID":"20250207122738-mlsdjty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122738-mlsdjty","updated":"20250207122738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空间复杂度的推算方法与时间复杂度大致相同，只需将统计对象从“操作数量”转为“使用空间大小”。"}]},{"ID":"20250207122738-d5ooz6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122738-d5ooz6d","updated":"20250207122742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而与时间复杂度不同的是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"我们通常只关注最差空间复杂度"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n这是因为内存空间是一项硬性要求，我们必须确保在所有输入数据下都有足够的内存空间预留。"}]},{"ID":"20250207122738-3lzgjhf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122738-3lzgjhf","updated":"20250207122831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"观察以下代码，最差空间复杂度中的“最差”有两层含义："}]},{"ID":"20250207122831-pgke1g4","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250207122831-pgke1g4","updated":"20250207122906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"void Algorithm1(int n)\n{\n    int a = 0;                   // O(1)\n    int[] b = new int[10000];    // O(1)\n    if (n \u003e 10)\n    {\n        int[] nums = new int[n]; // O(n)\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250207122753-642pski","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250207122753-642pski","updated":"20250207122828"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207122753-1uguixb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250207122753-1uguixb","updated":"20250207122816"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207122753-e6gdhap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122753-e6gdhap","updated":"20250207122816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"以最差输入数据为准"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：当 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n\u003c10"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 时，空间复杂度为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ；但当 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n\u003e10"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 时，初始化的数组 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 占用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 空间，因此最差空间复杂度为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "}]}]},{"ID":"20250207122753-ezcsst0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250207122753-ezcsst0","updated":"20250207122828"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207122753-zraikwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207122753-zraikwp","updated":"20250207122828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"以算法运行中的峰值内存为准"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：例如，程序在执行最后一行之前，占用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 空间；当初始化数组 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 时，程序占用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 空间，因此最差空间复杂度为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250207123010-xkyz5ld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207123010-xkyz5ld","updated":"20250207123011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"在递归函数中，需要注意统计栈帧空间"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。观察以下代码："}]},{"ID":"20250207123013-ig9n5iv","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250207123013-ig9n5iv","updated":"20250207123043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"int Function()\n{\n    // 执行某些操作\n    return 0;\n}\n/* 循环的空间复杂度为 O(1) */\nvoid Loop(int n)\n{\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c n; i++)\n    {\n        Function();\n    }\n}\n/* 递归的空间复杂度为 O(n) */\nint Recur(int n)\n{\n    if (n == 1) return 1;\n    return Recur(n - 1);\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250207123138-q4gi2q1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207123138-q4gi2q1","updated":"20250207123142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"函数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"loop()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"recur()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的时间复杂度都为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ，但空间复杂度不同。"}]},{"ID":"20250207123138-1ubtbb3","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250207123138-1ubtbb3","updated":"20250207123200"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207123138-mrgj0xt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250207123138-mrgj0xt","updated":"20250207123152"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207123138-nowoypt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207123138-nowoypt","updated":"20250207123152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"函数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"loop()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 在循环中调用了 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 次 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"function()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ ，每轮中的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"function()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 都返回并释放了栈帧空间，因此空间复杂度仍为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250207123138-spt5mjr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250207123138-spt5mjr","updated":"20250207123200"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250207123138-ogl53yr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207123138-ogl53yr","updated":"20250207123200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"递归函数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"recur()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 在运行过程中会同时存在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 个未返回的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"recur()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ ，从而占用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的栈帧空间。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250207123220-ihua3qf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250207123220-ihua3qf","updated":"20250207123456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常见类型"}]},{"ID":"20250207123223-zzbdcy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207123223-zzbdcy8","updated":"20250207123237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"设输入数据大小为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ，下图展示了常见的空间复杂度类型（从低到高排列）。"}]},{"ID":"20250207123243-40613aa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207123243-40613aa","updated":"20250207123243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 562px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250207123243-onfl83r.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 562px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250207123246-h7qe2d3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250207123246-h7qe2d3","updated":"20250207123456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常数阶 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(1)"}]},{"ID":"20250207123311-kxsiixb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207123311-kxsiixb","updated":"20250207123313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常数阶常见于数量与输入数据大小 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 无关的常量、变量、对象。"}]},{"ID":"20250207123311-d45aryg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207123311-d45aryg","updated":"20250207123355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"需要注意的是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"在循环中初始化变量或调用函数而占用的内存，在进入下一循环后就会被释放，因此不会累积占用空间"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，空间复杂度仍为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ："}]},{"ID":"20250207123320-josemcy","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250207123320-josemcy","updated":"20250207123419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"/* 函数 */\nint Function()\n{\n    // 执行某些操作\n    return 0;\n}\n\n/* 常数阶 */\nvoid Constant(int n)\n{\n    // 常量、变量、对象占用 O(1) 空间\n    int a = 0;\n    int b = 0;\n    int[] nums = new int[10000];\n    ListNode node = new(0);\n    // 循环中的变量占用 O(1) 空间\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c n; i++)\n    {\n        int c = 0;\n    }\n    // 循环中的函数占用 O(1) 空间\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c n; i++)\n    {\n        Function();\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250207123448-cbo96eu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250207123448-cbo96eu","updated":"20250207124331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线性阶 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText"}]},{"ID":"20250207123514-kzz6ofr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207123514-kzz6ofr","updated":"20250207123517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线性阶常见于元素数量与 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 成正比的数组、链表、栈、队列等："}]},{"ID":"20250207123518-zaanqjb","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250207123518-zaanqjb","updated":"20250207123608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"/* 线性阶 */\nvoid Linear(int n)\n{\n    // 长度为 n 的数组占用 O(n) 空间\n    int[] nums = new int[n];\n    // 长度为 n 的列表占用 O(n) 空间\n    List\u003cListNode\u003e nodes = [];\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c n; i++)\n    {\n        nodes.Add(new ListNode(i));\n    }\n    // 长度为 n 的哈希表占用 O(n) 空间\n    Dictionary\u003cint, string\u003e map = [];\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c n; i++)\n    {\n        map.Add(i, i.ToString());\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250207123655-0al30vx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207123655-0al30vx","updated":"20250207124331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"函数递归的空间复杂度也可能是线性阶的，如下图，下文函数的递归深度为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ，即同时存在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 个未返回的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"linear_recur()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 函数，使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 大小的栈帧空间："}]},{"ID":"20250207123716-w2rg87a","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250207123716-w2rg87a","updated":"20250207123736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"/* 线性阶（递归实现） */\nvoid LinearRecur(int n)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine(\"递归 n = \" + n);\n    if (n == 1) return;\n    LinearRecur(n - 1);\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250207123813-7v1mc60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207123813-7v1mc60","updated":"20250207123852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 497px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250207123813-khl62l3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 497px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250207123901-ny19cy3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250207123901-ny19cy3","updated":"20250207124327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平方阶 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n^2)"}]},{"ID":"20250207123918-vonlw42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207123918-vonlw42","updated":"20250207123928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平方阶常见于矩阵和图，元素数量与 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 成平方关系："}]},{"ID":"20250207123931-99uujzb","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250207123931-99uujzb","updated":"20250207123948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"/* 平方阶 */\nvoid Quadratic(int n)\n{\n    // 矩阵占用 O(n^2) 空间\n    int[,] numMatrix = new int[n, n];\n    // 二维列表占用 O(n^2) 空间\n    List\u003cList\u003cint\u003e\u003e numList = [];\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c n; i++)\n    {\n        List\u003cint\u003e tmp = [];\n        for (int j = 0; j \u003c n; j++)\n        {\n            tmp.Add(0);\n        }\n        numList.Add(tmp);\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250207124011-d75q38i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207124011-d75q38i","updated":"20250207124327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"函数递归的空间复杂度也可能是平方阶的，如下图，下文函数的递归深度为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ，在每个递归函数中都初始化了一个数组，长度分别为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n-1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"..."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，平均长度为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n/2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因此总体占用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(n^2)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 空间："}]},{"ID":"20250207124027-9rbn8f5","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250207124027-9rbn8f5","updated":"20250207124213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"/* 平方阶（递归实现） */\nint QuadraticRecur(int n)\n{\n    if (n \u003c= 0) return 0;\n    int[] nums = new int[n];\n    Console.WriteLine(\"递归 n = \" + n + \" 中的 nums 长度 = \" + nums.Length);\n    return QuadraticRecur(n - 1);\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250207124219-31x48xg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207124219-31x48xg","updated":"20250207124219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 562px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250207124219-bxmhay1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 562px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250207124230-qpu2fmk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250207124230-qpu2fmk","updated":"20250207124510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"指数阶 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(2^n)"}]},{"ID":"20250207124259-9g4ww92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207124259-9g4ww92","updated":"20250207124349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"指数阶常见于二叉树。观察下图 ，层数为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的“满二叉树”的节点数量为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"2^n−1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ，占用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(2^n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 空间："}]},{"ID":"20250207124350-q2u4vvh","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250207124350-q2u4vvh","updated":"20250207124415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"/* 指数阶（建立满二叉树） */\nTreeNode? BuildTree(int n)\n{\n    if (n == 0) return null;\n    TreeNode root = new(0)\n    {\n        left = BuildTree(n - 1),\n        right = BuildTree(n - 1)\n    };\n    return root;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250207124427-l0xpdka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207124427-l0xpdka","updated":"20250207124427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 533px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250207124427-tmsfwzk.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 533px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250207124455-0p1ch8l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250207124455-0p1ch8l","updated":"20250207124745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对数阶 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(\\log n)"}]},{"ID":"20250207124521-dm8qo72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207124521-dm8qo72","updated":"20250207124745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对数阶常见于分治算法。例如归并排序，输入长度为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的数组，每轮递归将数组从中点处划分为两半，形成高度为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\log ⁡n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的递归树，使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(\\log ⁡n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 栈帧空间"}]},{"ID":"20250207124521-ukqexu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207124521-ukqexu8","updated":"20250207124737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再例如将数字转化为字符串，输入一个正整数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ，它的位数为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"⌊\\log_{10}⁡n⌋+1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ，即对应字符串长度为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"⌊\\log_{10}⁡n⌋+1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ，因此空间复杂度为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"O(\\log_{10}⁡n+1)=O(\\log ⁡n)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "}]},{"ID":"20250207124801-qo4syun","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250207124801-qo4syun","updated":"20250207124831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"权衡时间与空间"}]},{"ID":"20250207124806-9gtqzhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250207124806-9gtqzhs","updated":"20250207124831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理想情况下，我们希望算法的时间复杂度和空间复杂度都能达到最优。然而在实际情况中，同时优化时间复杂度和空间复杂度通常非常困难。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"降低时间复杂度通常需要以提升空间复杂度为代价，反之亦然。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们将牺牲内存空间来提升算法运行速度的思路称为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"“以空间换时间”"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；反之，则称为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"“以时间换空间”"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n选择哪种思路取决于我们更看重哪个方面。在大多数情况下，时间比空间更宝贵，因此“以空间换时间”通常是更常用的策略。当然，在数据量很大的情况下，控制空间复杂度也非常重要。"}]}]}